<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.52 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.52 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 6.52 percent in the week ending September 21, 1996 from 6.25 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	 Sept 21     Sept 14     Sept 23,1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.52	  +6.25	  +9.01</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  317	    316.2	  297.6</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended September 23, 1995.</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301 2024</p>
</text>
